VaultMCP injection corpus
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Incorporated files:

  sentry_mcp/corpus/injection-patterns.json    200 labelled injection patterns
  sentry_mcp/corpus/corpus-sources.md          provenance for the above
  sentry_mcp/corpus/embeddings.bin             precomputed pattern embeddings
  sentry_mcp/corpus/embeddings-meta.json       embedding metadata

Upstream:  https://github.com/vaultmcp/vault  (packages/corpus/)
Commit:    66db948b28fc1aa42f52e7297c20b10f682a9065
Dated:     2026-07-22
Licence:   MIT

Only the corpus data is incorporated. No VaultMCP source code is included in
this project; the detection implementation here is original work. The corpus is
the post-contamination rebuild described in the upstream project's
POSTMORTEM-2026-05-20-contamination.md: 200 entries drawn from 13 public
sources, each carrying a mandatory `source` field. Entry provenance is preserved
verbatim in corpus-sources.md and in the per-entry `source` fields.

The embeddings were computed against `bge-small-en-v1.5`. Regenerating them
requires the same model; see corpus-sources.md.

